\qc\f1\fs36\b Silent Library Website\par
\fs28 Project Report\par
\pard\qc\f0\fs24\b0 User Interface Design\par
\par
\pard\sa120\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs24
\b Project overview\b0\par
This report explains the planning, design and development of the Silent Library website. The website was created as a responsive multi-page front-end experience for a community library. It gives visitors a clear path to discover books, learn about events and promotions, locate contact details, and understand the library's privacy practices. The project uses HTML for structure, CSS for visual design and interaction, and Bootstrap for responsive layout behaviour.\par
\par
